---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Who I am, what I think about, and how to reach me."
	pubDate={new Date('August 16 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I'm a product manager based in Oxford, UK, working mostly at the intersection of
		stakeholder management, workshop facilitation, and turning ambiguous requirements into
		something a team can actually ship. I like the parts of product work that involve getting a
		room of disagreeing people to a shared answer — and I'm endlessly curious about how that
		skill transfers to building things of my own.
	</p>
	<p>
		Outside the day job, I'm interested in career optionality: what it actually takes to build
		skills, income, and confidence outside a single employer, without blowing up the stable
		parts of life that are working fine. This site is part of that — a place to write in public,
		test small ideas, and keep a record of what I'm building rather than just thinking about
		building it.
	</p>
	<p>
		If something here is useful, wrong, or worth arguing about, get in touch — details are on
		the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
